{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"对角线"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"对角线"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在具有"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积"}},{"Plain":"的范畴中, 对象 $X$ 的对角线是由两个 $\\operatorname{id}_X\\colon X\\to X$ 确定的态射 $\\Delta_X\\colon X\\to X\\times X$.</p>\n"}]}}